    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970422.0093\n\nSEOUL, April 22 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nSeoul shares close 1.3 percent lower\n\n\n\n\nShare prices fell 1.3 percent on the Korea Stock Exchange Tuesday, hit by reports of financial problems at Jinro group subsidiaries, dealers said.\n\nThe composite index closed down 9.38 points at 687.96.",
